    {
      "zh": "人们说他是“书圣”，意思是写字的圣人。",
      "en": "People called him the \"Sage of Calligraphy\" — a saint of writing."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他和朋友在山里写下了很有名的字。",
      "en": "He and his friends wrote very famous characters in the mountains."
    },
    {
      "zh": "那些字到现在还有人看。",
      "en": "People still look at those characters today."
    },
    {
      "zh": "后来的人都想学他的字。",
      "en": "People in later times all wanted to learn his hand."
    },
    {
